=== N2a -- the CLI arm is replaced by the GUI arm (frozen definition) ===
  PLANTED DEFECT     yes
  CRITERION          PASSED -- the harness did NOT refuse
  DETECTION          UNDETECTED
  RESTORE            VERIFIED by SHA-256
  RETURN CODE        0 -- NOT expected

  N2a IS A CRITERION DEFECT, PRESERVED, NOT REDEFINED.
  The frozen gate requires the harness to 'declare the comparison
  vacuous and fail'. It does not. The harness header claims 'Every case
  asserts the two results came from different clients before comparing
  a single value' -- the assertions present (hasResults(), the
  completed() signal) prove the GUI arm RAN, not that the second arm is
  a DIFFERENT client. Comparing the GUI arm with itself therefore
  satisfies every E row for free. Reported as UNDETECTED.

