  RETURN CODE        nonzero (8), expected

=== N4 -- the CLI binary loses its --checkpoint-every validation ===
  frozen definition: 'point the CLI-flag ctests at a binary without the
  flags'. The ctests resolve their binary through $<TARGET_FILE:cfdapp> at
  configure time, so they cannot be repointed at another file without
  reconfiguring the project. The equivalent, and the failure mode V3's own
  comment names, is to build cfdapp WITHOUT the flag's validation so a bad
  interval becomes a silent 0. Recorded here rather than done silently.
  PLANTED DEFECT     yes
  CRITERION          FAILED as expected (2 tests)
  DETECTION          DETECTED
  RESTORE            VERIFIED by SHA-256
  RETURN CODE        nonzero (8), expected

